    dismiss; a released prompt names its sender.
  * One Backend and Session class per assistant; ended conversations can be
    resumed (conversations, start.resume).
  * Versions and updates: welcome.installed, usage.version, update.
  * welcome.assistants as objects with title and models.
  * The QR code comes from the bundled qrcodegen (MIT) instead of
    libqrencode.

